WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.934 --> 00:00:18.727
"It's a perfect day for the beach!" said Dad.

2
00:00:18.728 --> 00:00:22.970
Mom spread a blanket next to the cooler.

3
00:00:22.971 --> 00:00:30.538
Dad set up chairs and an umbrella.

4
00:00:30.539 --> 00:00:39.201
Mom put sunscreen on everyone.

5
00:00:39.202 --> 00:00:44.300
Oliver started building a sand castle.

6
00:00:44.301 --> 00:00:48.359
Mom put on her sunglasses.

7
00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:52.846
She opened a book.

8
00:00:52.847 --> 00:00:56.927
Dad, Emmy, and Harry went down to the water.

9
00:00:56.928 --> 00:01:03.989
Dad jumped into the waves.

10
00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:08.895
"Come in!" he called to Harry and Emmy.

11
00:01:08.896 --> 00:01:13.249
A small wave splashed over their feet.

12
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:15.996
"Brr!" said Emmy.

13
00:01:15.997 --> 00:01:20.509
"The water is freezing!"

14
00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:24.881
"It only feels cold at first," said Dad.

15
00:01:24.882 --> 00:01:30.112
Harry went a little deeper.

16
00:01:30.113 --> 00:01:33.236
The water was up to his knees.

17
00:01:33.237 --> 00:01:36.876
A wave came in and splashed Harry.

18
00:01:36.877 --> 00:01:43.133
Harry shivered and ran back out.

19
00:01:43.134 --> 00:01:49.817
Dad laughed. "You need to jump in quickly!" he said.

20
00:01:49.818 --> 00:01:53.545
"Then the water won't seem so cold."

21
00:01:53.546 --> 00:02:00.057
Dad dived under a big wave.

22
00:02:00.058 --> 00:02:08.570
Harry and Emmy went into the water again.

23
00:02:08.571 --> 00:02:13.415
"I'm going in slowly," said Harry.

24
00:02:13.416 --> 00:02:16.121
"Me too," said Emmy.

25
00:02:16.122 --> 00:02:18.518
"I don't want to jump in quick—"

26
00:02:18.519 --> 00:02:23.682
Splash! A huge wave knocked Emmy and Harry over!

27
00:02:23.683 --> 00:02:28.619
They tumbled with the wave.

28
00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:33.729
When they got up, they were soaked.

29
00:02:33.730 --> 00:02:36.771
Harry and Emmy laughed.

30
00:02:36.772 --> 00:02:39.453
"Dad was right," said Harry.

31
00:02:39.454 --> 00:02:48.822
"The water doesn't feel cold anymore!"
